            <zone fixed-size='39' forceUpdate='true' h='2372' id='11' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='93400' x='3300' y='6022'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#212121' fontsize='24'>The Carbon Cost of Wealth</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='0' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='26' forceUpdate='true' h='3042' id='12' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='93400' x='3300' y='8394'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run fontcolor='#424242' fontsize='14'>Do wealthy nations structurally emit more CO2? A statistical analysis of global inequality.</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin-bottom' value='24' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='1095' id='69' type-v2='text' w='93400' x='3300' y='11436'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#595959' fontsize='11'>Felipe Sebben | 15th Jan 2025</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin-top' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin-right' value='4' />
              <format attr='margin-bottom' value='0' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone fixed-size='1' h='2007' id='15' is-fixed='true' type-v2='empty' w='93400' x='3300' y='12531'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin-top' value='8' />
              <format attr='margin-bottom' value='24' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#e0e0e0' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='2069' id='16' type-v2='text' w='93400' x='3300' y='14538'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#212121' fontsize='16'>The Observed Data</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin-top' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin-bottom' value='8' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='8455' id='17' type-v2='text' w='93400' x='3300' y='16607'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#424242' fontsize='12'>When we divide the world&apos;s economies by median GDP (around $20k), a clear pattern emerges. Higher-income countries emit, on average, </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#424242' fontsize='12'>5.4 tons</run>
              <run fontcolor='#424242' fontsize='12'> more CO2 per capita than lower-income nations.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#424242' fontsize='12'>However, averages can be misleading. As shown below, the variance is significant. Several resource-rich developing nations emit more than efficient wealthy ones. This variability raises a question: </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#424242' fontsize='12'>Is this 5.4-ton gap a solid economic rule, or just a statistical fluke?</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin-bottom' value='24' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone fixed-size='460' h='27981' id='47' is-fixed='true' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='93400' x='3300' y='25062'>
            <zone fixed-size='46' h='3285' id='73' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='90200' x='4900' y='26035'>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='2798' id='49' type-v2='text' w='79000' x='4900' y='26035'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#212121' fontsize='14'>Wealthier nations generally emit more, but the spread is massive</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#546e7a' fontsize='12'>CO2 emissions per capita (tons) by Income Group. Toggle on the switch to visualize boxplots.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
