              <format attr='padding' value='16' />
              <format attr='padding-bottom' value='8' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#faf6f5' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone fixed-size='1' h='2981' id='26' is-fixed='true' type-v2='empty' w='93400' x='3300' y='53043'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin-top' value='24' />
              <format attr='margin-bottom' value='24' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#e0e0e0' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone fixed-size='450' h='27372' id='56' is-fixed='true' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='93400' x='3300' y='56024'>
            <zone fixed-size='26' forceUpdate='true' h='2069' id='27' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='93400' x='3300' y='56024'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#212121' fontsize='16'>The Statistical Inference</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin-top' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin-bottom' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='416' h='25303' id='58' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='93400' x='3300' y='58093'>
              <zone fixed-size='288' forceUpdate='true' h='25303' id='28' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='31200' x='3300' y='58093'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#424242' fontsize='12'>To determine if this emissions gap is robust, we cannot rely on a single calculation. We a used a statistical method called </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#424242' fontsize='12'>Boostrapping</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#424242' fontsize='12'> to stress-test the data.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#424242' fontsize='12'>We simulated the global economy </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#424242' fontsize='12'>3,000 times</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#424242' fontsize='12'>, randomly resampling countries and allowing the deffinition of &quot;Rich&quot; and &quot;Poor&quot; to shift in every iteration.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#424242' fontsize='12'>The Veredict: </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#424242' fontsize='12'>The inequality is structural. In 95% of simulated scenarios, the emissions gap falls between </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#424242' fontsize='12'>4.3</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#424242' fontsize='12'> and </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#424242' fontsize='12'>6.9 tons</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#424242' fontsize='12'>. Since this interval never crosses zero, we can conclude with high confidence that the environmental cost of wealth is real and significant.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin-right' value='24' />
                  <format attr='margin-bottom' value='0' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size='650' h='25303' id='60' is-fixed='true' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='62200' x='34500' y='58093'>
                <zone fixed-size='64' forceUpdate='true' h='4380' id='62' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='59000' x='36100' y='59066'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#212121' fontsize='14'>A robust gap</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#546e7a' fontsize='12'>Distribution of the gap across 3,000 simulations (95% Confidence Interval).</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin-bottom' value='8' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='300' h='18246' id='31' is-fixed='true' name='Histogram | Bootstrap' show-title='false' w='59000' x='36100' y='63446'>
                  <layout-cache has-max-size-h='true' has-max-size-w='true' maxheight='708' maxwidth='581' minheight='708' minwidth='581' type-h='scalable' type-w='scalable' />
                  <zone-style>
