          </zone>
          <zone fixed-size='185' h='11253' id='32' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='93400' x='3300' y='86377'>
            <zone fixed-size='292' h='9307' id='34' is-fixed='true' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='30000' x='4900' y='87350'>
              <zone fixed-size='15' forceUpdate='true' h='1399' id='35' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='29200' x='4900' y='87350'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#546e7a'>Data Source</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin-bottom' value='8' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size='45' forceUpdate='true' h='2980' id='37' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='29200' x='4900' y='88749'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#546e7a'>• </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#546e7a'>Timeframe:</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#546e7a'> To maximize global coverage (~190 countries), we used the most recent available year for each nation, ranging from 2014 to 2024.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin-bottom' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size='45' forceUpdate='true' h='2980' id='38' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='29200' x='4900' y='91729'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#546e7a'>• </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#546e7a'>Scope:</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#546e7a'> Emissions are </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#546e7a'>territorial</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#546e7a'> (production-based) and exclude Land-Use Change, and Forestry (LULUCF) to focus on industrial/energy footprints.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin-bottom' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size='15' forceUpdate='true' h='912' id='36' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='29200' x='4900' y='94709'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#546e7a'>• </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#546e7a'>Origin: </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#546e7a'>World Bank Development Indicators (WDI).</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin-right' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='281' h='9307' id='39' is-fixed='true' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='29700' x='34900' y='87350'>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='1399' id='40' type-v2='text' w='28100' x='35700' y='87350'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#546e7a'>Definitions and Cleaning</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin-bottom' value='8' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size='60' forceUpdate='true' h='3893' id='41' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='28100' x='35700' y='88749'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#546e7a'>• </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#546e7a'>Grouping:</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#546e7a'> Countries were divded into &quot;Higher&quot; and &quot;Lower&quot; income based on the </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#546e7a'>Global Median GDP (PPP)</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#546e7a'> of the sample. This threshold is dynamic and recalculated during simulation.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin-bottom' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size='45' forceUpdate='true' h='2737' id='42' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='28100' x='35700' y='92642'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#546e7a'>• </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#546e7a'>Outliers:</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#546e7a'>Æ </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#546e7a'>Palau</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#546e7a'> was excluded from the dataset as a statistical outlier (&gt; 78 tons/capita) to prevent skewing the point estimates.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin-right' value='8' />
                <format attr='margin-left' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='297' h='9307' id='43' is-fixed='true' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='30500' x='64600' y='87350'>
              <zone fixed-size='15' forceUpdate='true' h='1399' id='44' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='29700' x='65400' y='87350'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#546e7a'>Statistical Method</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin-bottom' value='8' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size='45' forceUpdate='true' h='2980' id='45' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='29700' x='65400' y='88749'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#546e7a'>• </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#546e7a'>Approach:</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#546e7a'> We used </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#546e7a'>Non-Parametric Bootstrapping</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#546e7a'> (3,000 iterations) to estimate the uncertainty of the emissions gap.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin-bottom' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size='60' forceUpdate='true' h='4137' id='46' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='29700' x='65400' y='91729'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#546e7a'>• </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#546e7a'>Why:</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#546e7a'> This method accounts for the high variance in the data and the sensitivity of the median-split threshold, providing a robust 95% Confidence Interval for the true structural difference.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin-left' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='padding' value='16' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
